# Stack Cell Monitor ABI1: d0 target IC housing,d1 address 0..511,d2 optional out.
poke 0 31416052
poke 1 1
poke 2 20
poke 5 1
poke 7 0
Loop:
yield
poke 5 4
move r0 -1
move r1 0
move r2 0
move r4 -1
bdnvl d0 ReferenceId Publish
l r2 d0 ReferenceId
l r3 d0 PrefabHash
beq r3 HASH("StructureCircuitHousing") TargetReady
beq r3 HASH("StructureCircuitHousingCompact") TargetReady
move r4 -2
j Publish
TargetReady:
move r4 -3
bdnvl d1 Setting Publish
l r0 d1 Setting
poke 5 2
move r4 -4
mod r3 r0 1
bnez r3 Publish
bltz r0 Publish
bgt r0 511 Publish
get r1 d0 r0
snan r4 r1
add r4 r4 1
j Publish
Publish:
poke 9 r0
poke 10 r1
poke 11 r2
poke 8 r4
get r3 db 7
add r3 r3 1
poke 7 r3 # complete sample generation publishes LAST
s db Setting r1
bdnvs d2 Setting Loop
s d2 Setting r1
j Loop
